{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22731","headline":"重过秘书旧房因题长句 · 白居易","name":"重过秘书旧房因题长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阁前下马思裴回，第二房门手自开。\n昔爲白面书郎去，今作苍须赞善来。\n吏人不识多新补，松竹相亲是旧栽。\n应有题墙名姓在，试将衫袖拂尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}